This is an unofficial fan implementation of Agricola, a board game
designed by Uwe Rosenberg and published by Lookout Spiele / Z-Man Games.
The Agricola name, rules, card text, and artwork are the property of
their respective copyright holders. This project is not affiliated
with, endorsed by, or sponsored by Lookout Spiele, Z-Man Games, or
Asmodee.

Game logic and behavior reference the Board Game Arena (BGA) Agricola
implementation. Per the BGA Studio license:
  "This code has been produced on the BGA studio platform for use on
   http://boardgamearena.com"

Card artwork is loaded from external sources (BGA CDN) at runtime
and is not distributed with this repository.

